njections and oral diabetes medications?&quot;,\n  &quot;Where can I find group fitness or social physical activities in suburban areas of Kiambu suitable for women aged 18â€“24?&quot;,\n  &quot;What are the benefits of combining walking with other types of exercise for diabetes management according to Kenyan health guidelines?&quot;,\n  &quot;Are there any government-provided wellness programs for civil servants with type 2 diabetes in Kiambu County?&quot;,\n  &quot;How does easy access to healthy foods in Kiambu suburban areas impact dietary management for young Kikuyu women with diabetes?&quot;\n]</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">Category</td>\n                <td class="p-2">diet</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">study_number</td>\n                <td class="p-2">8f5ed40f-6e34-40d4-b880-db309a5ae812</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">health_goals</td>\n                <td class="p-2">Can you give me some simple meal ideas or a sample daily menu I could follow?</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">output_format</td>\n                <td class="p-2">Text, Image and audio</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">type</td>\n                <td class="p-2">independent</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">parent</td>\n                <td class="p-2"></td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">label</td>\n                <td class="p-2">BAD</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">story_arc</td>\n                <td class="p-2">crisis_avoidance</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">output_tone</td>\n                <td class="p-2">crisis_avoidance</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n     \n    <style>\n            .guideline-html-content h1 {\n                font-size: 1.1rem;\n                font-weight: 800;\n                margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n            }\n\n            .guideline-html-content h2 {\n                font-size: 1rem;\n                font-weight: 700;\n                margin-bottom: 0.4rem;\n                margin-top: 1rem;\n            }\n\n            .guideline-html-content h3 {\n                font-size: 0.9rem;\n                font-weight: 600;\n                margin-bottom: 0.3rem;\n                margin-top: 0.8rem;\n            }\n\n            .guideline-html-content p {\n                margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n            }\n\n            .guideline-html-content ul,\n            .guideline-html-content ol {\n                margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n                padding-left: 1.25rem;\n            }\n\n            .guideline-html-content li {\n                margin-bottom: 0.2rem;\n            }\n\n            .guideline-html-content strong {\n                font-weight: 700;\n                color: #1e293b;\n            }\n        </style> </div> 	Let me tell you what happened to me, Wanjiku Mwangi, this past week. Every morning, I wake up just before sunrise and head straight to the kitchen. Who has time to think about fancy meals when you need to catch a minibus taxi and get to work in time? So, I just had a cuppa tea—no sugar, just a digestive biscuit—and out the door I went. But you know what happened on Monday? My manager asked me to organize the morning files. Something so simple, but halfway through, my hands started shaking and I felt so dizzy, ah, I couldn't finish. Why didn't I eat something proper? I thought I was just tired, but maybe it was more than that.\n\nLater that day, Sister Maseko from the local clinic saw me at the taxi rank. You know how nurses are—always looking after you. I tried to say I was fine, but she shook her head and called me aside. She told me, 'Wanjiku, you need to eat a proper breakfast and smaller meals during the day. For you, with your diabetes, try brown toast with scrambled eggs, or some plain yoghurt and fruit. Even a boiled sweet potato if you want something quick. It must be kosher and healthy, but don't skip meals because of work, neh?' I was not sure if I could change, but her advice sounded simple. Could it really be that easy?\n\nThe next day, I packed my bag with an apple, a wholewheat sandwich with cottage cheese and tomato, and a handful of raw nuts. Let me not lie, it felt strange and awkward eating at my desk just after prayers, and my colleagues laughed a bit. Midmorning came, and my body kept wanting the old sweet tea routine, not the crunchy apple. I almost gave in, but then I remembered, the boss said we will have a big project deadline at the end of the week. How will I manage if I can't finish simple tasks? That kept me trying.\n\nBy Thursday, something shifted. My energy was more steady, and my hands no longer shook when sorting the files. I started looking forward to my snack breaks—no more hiding. When the big Friday report needed organizing, I did it with a smile and no dizzy spells. I even shared my boiled sweet potatoes with MaLindi from accounts! I realized small changes could help me work better and stay healthy. Now, I'm planning new meal ideas each week. Maybe this is how we avoid bigger problems, neh?	{https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/images/official/8f5ed40f-6e34-40d4-b880-db309a5ae812_0.png,https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/images/official/8f5ed40f-6e34-40d4-b880-db309a5ae812_1.png,https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/images/official/8f5ed40f-6e34-40d4-b880-db309a5ae812_2.png,https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/images/official/8f5ed40f-6e34-40d4-b880-db309a5ae812_3.png}	{https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/audios/official/8f5ed40f-6e34-40d4-b880-db309a5ae812_0.mp3,https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/audios/official/8f5ed40f-6e34-40d4-b880-db309a5ae812_1.mp3,https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/audios/official/8f5ed40f-6e34-40d4-b880-db309a5ae812_2.mp3,https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/audios/official/8f5ed40f-6e34-40d4-b880-db309a5ae812_3.mp3}	Can you give me some simple meal ideas or a sample daily menu I could follow?	diet	female	independent	2026-03-01 15:11:08.886574+00	\N
