use ingredients easily available in Kiambuâ€™s suburban areas?&quot;,\n  &quot;How does daily alcohol consumption affect blood sugar for young Kikuyu men with type 2 diabetes in Kenya?&quot;,\n  &quot;Are there local healthcare clinics in Kiambu that provide specialized diabetes education or counseling for young adults?&quot;,\n  &quot;What healthy snack options are available from Kiambu markets that suit a lactose-free, low-glycemic diet for someone my age?&quot;,\n  &quot;Do Kikuyu church groups in Kiambu organize any diabetes awareness or health-check events that I could join?&quot;,\n  &quot;How can I balance my farming and gardening hobby with my need to manage type 2 diabetes and maintain regular physical activity?&quot;\n]</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">Category</td>\n                <td class="p-2">exercise</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">study_number</td>\n                <td class="p-2">6fada773-c6a2-47c9-a19d-0d1db10b26e4</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">health_goals</td>\n                <td class="p-2">How often and how long should I exercise to actually improve my health?</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">output_format</td>\n                <td class="p-2">Text, Image and audio</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">type</td>\n                <td class="p-2">independent</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">parent</td>\n                <td class="p-2"></td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">label</td>\n                <td class="p-2">GOOD</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">story_arc</td>\n                <td class="p-2">iteration</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">output_tone</td>\n                <td class="p-2">iteration</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n     \n    <style>\n            .guideline-html-content h1 {\n                font-size: 1.1rem;\n                font-weight: 800;\n                margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n            }\n\n            .guideline-html-content h2 {\n                font-size: 1rem;\n                font-weight: 700;\n                margin-bottom: 0.4rem;\n                margin-top: 1rem;\n            }\n\n            .guideline-html-content h3 {\n                font-size: 0.9rem;\n                font-weight: 600;\n                margin-bottom: 0.3rem;\n                margin-top: 0.8rem;\n            }\n\n            .guideline-html-content p {\n                margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n            }\n\n            .guideline-html-content ul,\n            .guideline-html-content ol {\n                margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n                padding-left: 1.25rem;\n            }\n\n            .guideline-html-content li {\n                margin-bottom: 0.2rem;\n            }\n\n            .guideline-html-content strong {\n                font-weight: 700;\n                color: #1e293b;\n            }\n        </style> </div> 	Sho, my name is Kamau Mwangi, and every morning I wake up early in Kiambu, you know. I drink my hot tea with some sweet potato, and off to the farm I go. I work very hard, walking between the neat rows of green leaves, but I never stop to think—am I doing enough for my health? The other day, I tried to move my heavy basket full of fresh tea leaves to the shed like every day, but eish, my legs were so tired, and I even dropped the basket, spilling the leaves everywhere. Was it because I skip my stretches? Maybe I walk in the field, but is that exercise? I didn’t know.\n\nOne afternoon, Nurse Wanjiku, a kind lady from the local clinic, spotted me at the market. "Kamau, why do you look so tired?" she asked, holding her notebook. I smiled and shrugged, feeling shy. My people sometimes say exercise is just for the young, but she told me in simple words, exercising 30 minutes, five days a week—even brisk walking—can make a big difference. She said, "Kamau, just plan a little. A morning walk, a dance with your friends from church, or even stretching when you finish your farm work. It’s your medicine, together with your food." Her words made sense but, eish, what if I don’t have time with all the work and prayers?\n\nThe next day, I put on my thick blue jacket early, telling myself, "Kamau, you can do it." I tried Nurse Wanjiku’s advice and walked quickly to the river before starting my farm chores. My body ached, and I wanted to stop before thirty minutes, but I remembered I had to clear and plant a new vegetable bed for the community project soon. That thought pushed me on, but I still moved slower than usual and nearly left my hat behind because I was not used to waking up earlier. This new routine was harder than I thought, but I wanted to finish the big job with more strength.\n\nTwo weeks later, I started feeling lighter, even smiling as I greeted the sunrise on my walks. My legs felt strong when I lifted the full basket, and when the day came to clear the new bed for the church group, I worked with more energy and less sweating. Is it not amazing, how little steps can bring so much change? Now, I even show my friends my new walking route, and I promise, I will keep trying this exercise thing—maybe it will help me live long to see my tea farm grow.	{https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/images/official/6fada773-c6a2-47c9-a19d-0d1db10b26e4_0.png,https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/images/official/6fada773-c6a2-47c9-a19d-0d1db10b26e4_1.png,https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/images/official/6fada773-c6a2-47c9-a19d-0d1db10b26e4_2.png,https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/images/official/6fada773-c6a2-47c9-a19d-0d1db10b26e4_3.png}	{https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/audios/official/6fada773-c6a2-47c9-a19d-0d1db10b26e4_0.mp3,https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/audios/official/6fada773-c6a2-47c9-a19d-0d1db10b26e4_1.mp3,https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/audios/official/6fada773-c6a2-47c9-a19d-0d1db10b26e4_2.mp3,https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/audios/official/6fada773-c6a2-47c9-a19d-0d1db10b26e4_3.mp3}	How often and how long should I exercise to actually improve my health?	exercise	male	independent	2026-03-01 15:11:10.578565+00	\N
