o city where I can stay active while engaging in my hobbies?&quot;,\n  &quot;Does walking in urban Kano provide enough cardiovascular benefit for diabetes control, or should I include other exercises too?&quot;,\n  &quot;Are there any local Hausa herbal remedies for diabetes that can be safely used alongside insulin and Metformin?&quot;,\n  &quot;How do other young Hausa Muslim women in Kano manage rare tobacco and alcohol use with type 2 diabetes and regular socialising?&quot;,\n  &quot;Which local healthcare clinics in Kano offer diabetes counseling specific to women who are traders and want to improve their physical activity?&quot;\n]</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">Category</td>\n                <td class="p-2">exercise</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">study_number</td>\n                <td class="p-2">c80afba1-2b57-4cb4-b952-83b66b3713a0</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">health_goals</td>\n                <td class="p-2">How often and how long should I exercise to actually improve my health?</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">output_format</td>\n                <td class="p-2">Text, Image and audio</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">type</td>\n                <td class="p-2">independent</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">parent</td>\n                <td class="p-2"></td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">label</td>\n                <td class="p-2">BAD</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">story_arc</td>\n                <td class="p-2">crisis_avoidance</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">output_tone</td>\n                <td class="p-2">crisis_avoidance</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n     \n    <style>\n            .guideline-html-content h1 {\n                font-size: 1.1rem;\n                font-weight: 800;\n                margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n            }\n\n            .guideline-html-content h2 {\n                font-size: 1rem;\n                font-weight: 700;\n                margin-bottom: 0.4rem;\n                margin-top: 1rem;\n            }\n\n            .guideline-html-content h3 {\n                font-size: 0.9rem;\n                font-weight: 600;\n                margin-bottom: 0.3rem;\n                margin-top: 0.8rem;\n            }\n\n            .guideline-html-content p {\n                margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n            }\n\n            .guideline-html-content ul,\n            .guideline-html-content ol {\n                margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n                padding-left: 1.25rem;\n            }\n\n            .guideline-html-content li {\n                margin-bottom: 0.2rem;\n            }\n\n            .guideline-html-content strong {\n                font-weight: 700;\n                color: #1e293b;\n            }\n        </style> </div> 	Every morning, I, Chinelo Okafor, wake up to the sound of birds outside my window in our friendly neighbourhood. I eat my brown rice and vegetable stew for breakfast before I wash and get dressed. One day, I told myself, 'Let me sweep the yard quickly before I go to the hospital for my insulin.' But as I started, my legs felt heavy and my hands shaky. I wondered—why do I run out of energy so fast? Is something wrong with my exercise or what?\n\nThat very day at the local clinic, Sister Amina the nurse noticed my tired face. She smiled and asked, 'Chinelo, how often do you exercise?' I answered, 'I try, but I don’t really know if it’s helping me.' Sister Amina explained gently, 'You should try to do physical activity most days of the week, even if it’s just brisk walking. Aim for about 30 minutes each time. Start small, rest in between, and listen to your body, my sister.' I nodded so she’d know I was listening, but I still wasn’t sure if I could manage it.\n\nThe next morning, I put on my light, bright hijab and comfy shoes and went outside to walk. At first, I felt silly, and people smiled as they passed me. Not even halfway, I wanted to turn back, but I remembered I would have to help cook the big family meal for Eid soon. I carried on, walking a bit, resting a bit, always thinking, 'Can I keep this up?'\n\nAfter a week passed, I noticed my body started to feel lighter and I could sweep the whole yard without stopping to rest. When Eid came, I prepared the big meal with my family and did not feel weak or tired. Now, I feel proud and ready to keep moving—who knew small steps could prepare me for the big day, hey?	{https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/images/official/c80afba1-2b57-4cb4-b952-83b66b3713a0_0.png,https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/images/official/c80afba1-2b57-4cb4-b952-83b66b3713a0_1.png,https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/images/official/c80afba1-2b57-4cb4-b952-83b66b3713a0_2.png,https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/images/official/c80afba1-2b57-4cb4-b952-83b66b3713a0_3.png}	{https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/audios/official/c80afba1-2b57-4cb4-b952-83b66b3713a0_0.mp3,https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/audios/official/c80afba1-2b57-4cb4-b952-83b66b3713a0_1.mp3,https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/audios/official/c80afba1-2b57-4cb4-b952-83b66b3713a0_2.mp3,https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/audios/official/c80afba1-2b57-4cb4-b952-83b66b3713a0_3.mp3}	How often and how long should I exercise to actually improve my health?	exercise	female	independent	2026-02-22 22:59:00.551216+00	\N
