management?&quot;,\n  &quot;What are some traditional isiXhosa lactose-free meals that are suitable for someone with type 2 diabetes living in the countryside?&quot;,\n  &quot;Where can I find or request diabetes education workshops in isiXhosa at local healthcare clinics in the rural Eastern Cape?&quot;,\n  &quot;How does regular participation in rural traditional dance impact blood sugar control and overall health for women with type 2 diabetes?&quot;,\n  &quot;What locally available foods in small Eastern Cape villages are affordable, lactose-free, and beneficial for diabetes management?&quot;,\n  &quot;How can high alcohol consumption among women with type 2 diabetes in rural Eastern Cape communities be safely reduced or managed?&quot;,\n  &quot;Are there any support groups for women teachers with diabetes in rural South Africa that meet regularly for both exercise and sharing healthy recipes?&quot;\n]</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">Category</td>\n                <td class="p-2">exercise</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">study_number</td>\n                <td class="p-2">750f5e63-3aa1-4e6b-a7e4-027589f42b37</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">health_goals</td>\n                <td class="p-2">What kinds of exercises are safe and helpful for someone with diabetes?</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">output_format</td>\n                <td class="p-2">Text, Image and audio</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">type</td>\n                <td class="p-2">independent</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">parent</td>\n                <td class="p-2"></td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">label</td>\n                <td class="p-2">GOOD</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">story_arc</td>\n                <td class="p-2">iteration</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">output_tone</td>\n                <td class="p-2">iteration</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n     \n    <style>\n            .guideline-html-content h1 {\n                font-size: 1.1rem;\n                font-weight: 800;\n                margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n            }\n\n            .guideline-html-content h2 {\n                font-size: 1rem;\n                font-weight: 700;\n                margin-bottom: 0.4rem;\n                margin-top: 1rem;\n            }\n\n            .guideline-html-content h3 {\n                font-size: 0.9rem;\n                font-weight: 600;\n                margin-bottom: 0.3rem;\n                margin-top: 0.8rem;\n            }\n\n            .guideline-html-content p {\n                margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n            }\n\n            .guideline-html-content ul,\n            .guideline-html-content ol {\n                margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n                padding-left: 1.25rem;\n            }\n\n            .guideline-html-content li {\n                margin-bottom: 0.2rem;\n            }\n\n            .guideline-html-content strong {\n                font-weight: 700;\n                color: #1e293b;\n            }\n        </style> </div> 	So, after break, Sister Nomsa, our local clinic nurse, came by to check on staff. She heard that I wasn’t my usual chatty self in the staffroom. Gently, she asked about my meals and when I last exercised. I shrugged, you know? She said, 'Hayi, Mihlali, you must try walking or gentle dancing three times a week. Exercise helps your sugar – not only hard work.' She said to always eat at regular times, even if it’s just an apple or a handful of nuts before lessons. Walking around the schoolyard counts, especially if you’re moving happy, not rushing. Eish, isn’t that simple?\n\nI thought, okay let’s try. The next day, I put on my doek and sneakers early. I did one lap around the soccer field at school before assembling the learners. Yoh, I was slow! My legs felt heavy, but I kept Sister Nomsa’s words in mind. By lunchtime, I felt proud but was nearly tempted to skip my next snack – habits don’t change by themselves. I remembered the big task tomorrow: leading umxhentso dance for Heritage Day. That is my joy! I didn’t give up, I just took a breath and packed my fruit for the afternoon.\n\nBy Friday, I started to feel better. My body still complains now and then – who doesn’t wince a bit when trying something new? But I gathered the girls, and we practiced the dance. I could finish the practice without feeling dizzy. There, I managed my insulin and snack without missing a step! The classroom was neat, ready for inspection at last. That day I thought, maybe, little by little, these health changes add up. I can plan more, try new snacks, and walk even when it rains lightly. Now, I’m ready to keep learning more.	{https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/images/official/750f5e63-3aa1-4e6b-a7e4-027589f42b37_0.png,https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/images/official/750f5e63-3aa1-4e6b-a7e4-027589f42b37_1.png,https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/images/official/750f5e63-3aa1-4e6b-a7e4-027589f42b37_2.png}	{https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/audios/official/750f5e63-3aa1-4e6b-a7e4-027589f42b37_0.mp3,https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/audios/official/750f5e63-3aa1-4e6b-a7e4-027589f42b37_1.mp3,https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/audios/official/750f5e63-3aa1-4e6b-a7e4-027589f42b37_2.mp3}	What kinds of exercises are safe and helpful for someone with diabetes?	exercise	female	independent	2026-02-22 23:02:41.947719+00	\N
