tolic church groups in Eastern Cape that offer diabetes support or health education sessions?&quot;,\n  &quot;How does daily tobacco smoking affect blood sugar control and medication effectiveness for young South African men with Type 2 diabetes?&quot;,\n  &quot;What are some engaging exercise options for men aged 18–24 in urban Eastern Cape, besides walking, that fit a working adult lifestyle?&quot;,\n  &quot;Are there any local initiatives or programs in the Eastern Cape encouraging diabetes-friendly lifestyles among male teachers?&quot;,\n  &quot;Which healthy kosher snack options are commonly available in Eastern Cape city supermarkets for someone with diabetes?&quot;,\n  &quot;How can storytelling and praise poetry (iintsomi, izibongo) be used as tools for health education about diabetes management in urban IsiXhosa communities?&quot;\n]</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">Category</td>\n                <td class="p-2">exercise</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">study_number</td>\n                <td class="p-2">55f756a2-4331-4c13-a370-b33f6f292099</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">health_goals</td>\n                <td class="p-2">What kinds of exercises are safe and helpful for someone with diabetes?</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">output_format</td>\n                <td class="p-2">Text, Image and audio</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">type</td>\n                <td class="p-2">independent</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">parent</td>\n                <td class="p-2"></td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">label</td>\n                <td class=