as benefit diabetes management for working adults?&quot;,\n  &quot;Are there local Christian (African Independent Church) events or community gatherings in Kisumu that promote healthy living and diabetes awareness?&quot;,\n  &quot;What herbal or traditional medicines used by the Luo community in Kisumu are considered safe for use alongside insulin and Metformin?&quot;,\n  &quot;How does anxiety or depression commonly affect diabetes self-management among young Luo men, and what local healthcare support is available?&quot;,\n  &quot;What are common challenges maize farmers in urban Kenya face in maintaining regular exercise routines and healthy eating habits?&quot;,\n  &quot;Where can I find halal, diabetes-friendly meal options or restaurants in Kisumu city?&quot;\n]</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">Category</td>\n                <td class="p-2">diet</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">study_number</td>\n                <td class="p-2">65e84a3a-f93d-4ba7-8514-8cee2d13c70a</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">health_goals</td>\n                <td class="p-2">I like to snack—what are some healthy options and how often should I have them?</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">output_format</td>\n                <td class="p-2">Text, Image and audio</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">type</td>\n                <td class="p-2">independent</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">parent</td>\n                <td class="p-2"></td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">label</td>\n                <td class="p-2">GOOD</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n         