culture that offer healthy, gluten-free food options for someone monitoring blood pressure and blood sugar?&quot;,\n  &quot;Are there any government or NGO programs in Siaya that support livestock keepers managing chronic conditions like diabetes?&quot;,\n  &quot;How do local Christian (other) beliefs in Siaya intersect with traditional approaches to diabetes care?&quot;,\n  &quot;Which local Luo herbal or traditional medicines are commonly used alongside insulin or metformin, and are they safe?&quot;,\n  &quot;What is the average cost and availability of daily diabetes medications and healthy foods in suburban Siaya for livestock keepers?&quot;,\n  &quot;How can I balance a busy working adult routine as a livestock keeper in Siaya with the recommended frequency of physical activity for diabetes control?&quot;\n]</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">Category</td>\n                <td class="p-2">exercise</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">study_number</td>\n                <td class="p-2">e2f9089f-3fa7-418e-8e90-d57436fa29d1</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">health_goals</td>\n                <td class="p-2">What kinds of exercises are safe and helpful for someone with diabetes?</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">output_format</td>\n                <td class="p-2">Text, Image and audio</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">type</td>\n                <td class="p-2">overlapped</td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">parent</td>\n                <td class="p-2"></td>\n            </tr>\n        \n            <tr>\n                <td class="p-2 font-bold">label</td>\n                <td class="p-2">EXCELLENT</td>\n         