he water stayed by the borehole.\n\nLater, at the local health clinic, Nurse Atieno saw me resting outside. She noticed my worry and sat next to me, talking in Dholuo, 'David, you love your cows, but who will look after them if you don’t look after yourself?' I wanted to say I know, I know – but truth is, I was confused about how much movement was safe. She smiled, telling me, 'Simple exercises, like walking in the mornings, stretching your arms and legs after milking, even dancing for a short time with your family, will help your sugar and pressure. No need for heavy lifting or difficult moves. Just keep it gentle and regular.'\n\nThe next days were not easy. I tried to go for a walk after feeding the goats, but I kept forgetting or stopping early – my legs felt heavy, and old habits pulled me home quickly. Still, I remembered Nurse Atieno’s words, especially since the weekend I had a big job: fixing my cattle fence before rainy season. I told myself, 'David, just try for your cows and for your family.'\n\nBy Saturday, I felt a small change. My energy in the mornings was steadier. I had walked around the compound most days and stretched after work. This time, when I went to repair the fence, I finished the job with a strong body and peaceful heart. I even asked my son to join for a walk later! Now I see, caring for myself helps me care for my animals and my family. I am ready to keep improving, bit by bit.	{https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/images/official/e2f9089f-3fa7-418e-8e90-d57436fa29d1_0.png,https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/images/official/e2f9089f-3fa7-418e-8e90-d57436fa29d1_1.png,https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/images/official/e2f9089f-3fa7-418e-8e90-d57436fa29d1_2.png,https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/images/official/e2f9089f-3fa7-418e-8e90-d57436fa29d1_3.png}	{https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/audios/official/e2f9089f-3fa7-418e-8e90-d57436fa29d1_0.mp3,https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/audios/official/e2f9089f-3fa7-418e-8e90-d57436fa29d1_1.mp3,https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/audios/official/e2f9089f-3fa7-418e-8e90-d57436fa29d1_2.mp3,https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/audios/official/e2f9089f-3fa7-418e-8e90-d57436fa29d1_3.mp3}	What kinds of exercises are safe and helpful for someone with diabetes?	exercise	male	overlapped	2026-02-24 14:11:12.376688+00	\N
